  "metadata": {
    "path": "$TO/.claude",
    "landsAt": "$OUTSIDE",
    "hint": "point that .claude dir back inside the repo, then rerun \`rhx init --hooks\`"
  }
}"
`;

exports[`writeClaudeCodeSettings never writes outside the dir it was aimed at given: [case2] a \`.claude\` that is a broken link when: [t0] the write is called then: it refuses, with the link target named 1`] = `
